":600,"evidenceKey":"SimGame2Forge:description:5006"},{"id":"5007","name":"Waterproof Blanket","salesXP":290,"coinsPerSecond":45,"seconds":780,"evidenceKey":"SimGame2Forge:description:5007"},{"id":"5008","name":"Self-Heating Pot","salesXP":340,"coinsPerSecond":55,"seconds":780,"evidenceKey":"SimGame2Forge:description:5008"},{"id":"5009","name":"Portable Tent","salesXP":585,"coinsPerSecond":75,"seconds":900,"evidenceKey":"SimGame2Forge:description:5009"},{"id":"5010","name":"Saddle","salesXP":680,"coinsPerSecond":90,"seconds":900,"evidenceKey":"SimGame2Forge:description:5010"}],"rules":[{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_1","en":"- Workshop Manufacturing -"},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_10","en":"- Deposit Box -"},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_11","en":"\u25c6 Earnings from the Workshop will be stored in the Deposit Box."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_12","en":"\u25c6 Claim Earnings manually by tapping on the Deposit Box. There is no storage limit, and Earnings can be claimed at any time."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_13","en":"- Product List -"},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_14","en":"\u25c6 Different kinds of products provide different effects, some of which will improve the Power of Fellows."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_15","en":"\u25c6 Manufacturing a product multiple times will raise its level."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_16","en":"- Evaluation Earnings -"},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_17","en":"\u25c6 After manufacturing is completed, an evaluation for the corresponding product will be received. The better the evaluation, the more additional Earnings will be received."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_18","en":"\u25c6 When making products of a higher quality it will be easier to get a good evaluation."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_19","en":"- Workshop Store -"},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_2","en":"\u25c6 Assign Fellows to begin operating the Workshop. Manufacturing tasks cannot be canceled halfway through the process."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_20","en":"\u25c6 Earnings sent to the Deposit Box can be exchanged for rare items in the Workshop Store."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_3","en":"\u25c6 Manufacturing consumes manufacturing materials. Items can also be manufactured in batches."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_4","en":"\u25c6 Only one Fellow can be assigned to each manufacturing task. After manufacturing is completed, this Fellow will gain Sales EXP."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_5","en":"\u25c6 Only one product can be selected for manufacture each time. Fellows can only manufacture products that correspond to their type."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_6","en":"\u25c6 Players will receive tokens throughout the manufacturing process. The higher the quality of the products being manufactured, the more tokens will be received."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_7","en":"- Daily Hot Products -"},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_8","en":"\u25c6 The list of daily hot products will refresh at midnight every day."},{"id":"Rule:text:SimGame2_9","en":"\u25c6 Manufacturing hot products will grant an additional 20% Sales EXP."}],"sandbox":{"supplyPerUnit":1,"freeRestock":20,"pearlPrice":2000,"unlocks":"one craft of previous group product","hotRotation":"one product per group daily UTC","evaluation":"not modeled; odds and multipliers missing"}}
